 "summary": "The new surface is coherent: additive-functor lemmas carry `@[simp]` consistently with `map_id_add`/`map_id_zero`, `subgroupOfCohomologyIso` has its `_hom` characterization, and the exponent-form and finite-index Sylow criteria generalize rather than duplicate the existing `Complement/{Gaschutz,Sylow}` API (whose hypotheses `[Finite N]`/`[P.FiniteIndex]` are incomparable with `[N.FiniteIndex]`). No compatibility layer, over-exposed body, or misplaced private infrastructure.",
